# =====================================================================
# bench durable dev env  —  load with:  source config/bench.env
# (the Python driver entrypoints also auto-load this via bench.benv)
#
# Bench identity is NOT defined in this file. The bench identity is
# supplied as a single seed-hex input:
# env OKP_BENCH_MCP_SEED takes priority, else the 0600 file
# ~/.okp/bench/bench-identity-seed.txt. No seed or wallet value lives here.
# =====================================================================

# --- Durable bench keystore home (directory paths, the mcp appends keys.json) ---
# Moved off /tmp on 2026-07-26 after /tmp power-loss eviction destroyed the
# bench-org master key. Code default is ~/.okp/bench/leader-keystore.
# Uncomment to override explicitly on this machine:
# export OKP_BENCH_LEADER_KEYSTORE=$HOME/.okp/bench/leader-keystore
